ledger: C1
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 400 do
  @outer = stack width: 300, height: 200 do
    @half = stack height: 0.5
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_equal 0.5, stack("@half").style[:height], "the style keeps the decimal as asked for"
assert_equal 100, stack("@half").height, "a decimal height is that fraction of the parent's height"
